1
00:01:59,840 --> 00:02:00,980
Xiaoyu is asleep.

2
00:02:14,139 --> 00:02:15,960
The stars are so beautiful tonight.

3
00:02:17,400 --> 00:02:19,240
When I was a child, my mother told me

4
00:02:20,560 --> 00:02:22,159
that every star in the sky

5
00:02:22,979 --> 00:02:24,900
corresponds to a person on earth.

6
00:02:26,759 --> 00:02:28,300
Everyone loves stars.

7
00:02:29,400 --> 00:02:30,060
Maybe it's because

8
00:02:30,060 --> 00:02:31,419
they are eternal and unchanging.

9
00:02:32,400 --> 00:02:34,240
Everyone hopes that the person they love

10
00:02:34,560 --> 00:02:36,780
can be like the stars,

11
00:02:37,520 --> 00:02:39,139
providing eternal companionship.

12
00:02:41,639 --> 00:02:42,300
Pingjun,

13
00:02:44,840 --> 00:02:46,020
will you blame me?

14
00:02:48,199 --> 00:02:49,620
After all, our family

15
00:02:51,020 --> 00:02:52,580
has finally reunited.

16
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:03,979
Changxuan,

17
00:03:06,599 --> 00:03:07,860
remember,

18
00:03:09,900 --> 00:03:11,539
no matter where you go,

19
00:03:13,300 --> 00:03:14,699
you're never alone.

20
00:03:16,819 --> 00:03:18,379
I'll always be with you.

21
00:03:26,500 --> 00:03:27,439
Ye Pingjun,

22
00:03:28,659 --> 00:03:29,800
I want you to know,

23
00:03:31,819 --> 00:03:33,300
in this turbulent world,

24
00:03:35,139 --> 00:03:36,659
amidst the storm,

25
00:03:39,939 --> 00:03:41,699
in my heart,

26
00:03:43,539 --> 00:03:44,840
from the beginning to the end,

27
00:03:46,939 --> 00:03:49,139
you are the only one.

28
00:03:59,460 --> 00:04:00,360
I know.

29
00:04:16,439 --> 00:04:17,779
Xiaoyu said

30
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:20,800
you promised him to take him to Maple Platform

31
00:04:21,800 --> 00:04:23,639
to see maple leaves this autumn.

32
00:04:27,699 --> 00:04:28,800
When I come back,

33
00:04:30,639 --> 00:04:31,660
we will

34
00:04:32,639 --> 00:04:34,180
plant a maple tree for him,

35
00:04:34,180 --> 00:04:34,779
okay?

36
00:04:36,660 --> 00:04:38,079
When the maple tree grows up,

37
00:04:39,540 --> 00:04:40,920
we can use its leaves

38
00:04:42,339 --> 00:04:43,839
as bookmarks for Xiaoyu.

39
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,420
When Xiaoyu goes to school,

40
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:48,680
it can always be with him.

41
00:04:52,420 --> 00:04:53,220
Okay.

42
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:56,560
Deal.

43
00:04:58,259 --> 00:04:59,379
You must keep your promise.

44
00:05:02,300 --> 00:05:03,319
Deal.

45
00:05:16,819 --> 00:05:17,639
By the way,

46
00:05:19,139 --> 00:05:20,360
I asked the kitchen

47
00:05:20,519 --> 00:05:21,879
to boil some milk for me.

48
00:05:22,300 --> 00:05:24,560
I'll go check on it. Be right back.

49
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:05,279
Flying!

50
00:06:05,839 --> 00:06:07,839
Flying!

51
00:06:08,540 --> 00:06:09,519
Grandpa!

52
00:06:11,420 --> 00:06:13,279
Grandpa, I want a hug too!

53
00:06:13,540 --> 00:06:15,100
Okay, come here.

54
00:06:15,779 --> 00:06:16,639
Grandpa will hug you.

55
00:06:17,339 --> 00:06:18,500
You're so heavy!

56
00:06:19,839 --> 00:06:21,500
I can hold you,

57
00:06:21,819 --> 00:06:22,879
but how do I

58
00:06:22,879 --> 00:06:23,839
put you down?

59
00:06:23,839 --> 00:06:24,420
Sofa.

60
00:06:24,819 --> 00:06:25,980
Okay, sofa.

61
00:06:36,639 --> 00:06:38,259
How come it's just the two of you?

62
00:06:39,339 --> 00:06:40,319
Where are mom and dad?

63
00:06:40,319 --> 00:06:41,879
Mom went to see dad off.

64
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:43,160
Dad is going on a long trip

65
00:06:43,160 --> 00:06:44,740
to fight the Japanese.

66
00:06:46,279 --> 00:06:47,120
Grandpa,

67
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:49,399
shall we play hide and seek?

68
00:06:49,399 --> 00:06:50,199
Hide and seek?

69
00:06:50,199 --> 00:06:50,720
Okay.

70
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:52,060
I'll count to ten.

71
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:52,860
Cover your eyes.

72
00:06:52,899 --> 00:06:53,279
Okay.

73
00:06:53,279 --> 00:06:54,240
Count with eyes covered.

74
00:06:54,740 --> 00:06:55,360
One.

75
00:06:57,579 --> 00:06:58,720
Two.

76
00:07:02,019 --> 00:07:03,220
Three.

77
00:07:05,339 --> 00:07:06,399
Four.

78
00:07:09,899 --> 00:07:11,060
Five.

79
00:07:13,420 --> 00:07:14,439
Six.

80
00:07:16,459 --> 00:07:17,399
[Seven.]

81
00:07:22,980 --> 00:07:23,959
[Eight.]

82
00:07:26,459 --> 00:07:27,560
[Today is the Great Snow.]

83
00:07:28,759 --> 00:07:29,800
[My classmates asked me,]

84
00:07:30,360 --> 00:07:32,220
[born into a wealthy family,]

85
00:07:32,399 --> 00:07:33,639
[enjoying all the splendor,]

86
00:07:34,399 --> 00:07:36,100
[why do I come to this foreign land]

87
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:37,519
[to seek a way to save the country?]

88
00:07:38,699 --> 00:07:39,920
[My father always says]

89
00:07:40,620 --> 00:07:41,339
[that only with military power]

90
00:07:41,339 --> 00:07:42,779
[can we protect our family.]

91
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:44,699
[But if this beautiful land]

92
00:07:44,699 --> 00:07:45,660
[becomes a wasteland,]

93
00:07:45,660 --> 00:07:46,779
[the country will cease to exist.]

94
00:07:47,259 --> 00:07:48,480
[And what will happen to our family?]

95
00:07:49,899 --> 00:07:50,920
[One day,]

96
00:07:51,920 --> 00:07:53,199
[if someone has to]

97
00:07:53,199 --> 00:07:54,879
[fight to the death for the country,]

98
00:07:54,980 --> 00:07:56,800
[I, Yu Mingxuan, will be the first one.]

99
00:07:58,060 --> 00:07:59,660
[I will die without regrets.]

100
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:02,560
[May future generations]

101
00:08:02,980 --> 00:08:03,699
[always have the right to choose]

102
00:08:03,699 --> 00:08:05,180
[why they live,]

103
00:08:06,019 --> 00:08:08,259
and be free from slavery.

104
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:39,860
Attention!

105
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,019
At ease.

106
00:08:41,740 --> 00:08:42,460
Attention!

107
00:08:43,159 --> 00:08:44,559
Eyes right!

108
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:46,980
Eyes front!

109
00:09:02,940 --> 00:09:04,159
I'll take care of

110
00:09:04,519 --> 00:09:06,259
your mother and children.

111
00:09:07,139 --> 00:09:08,440
Don't worry.

112
00:09:10,240 --> 00:09:11,019
Pingjun,

113
00:09:12,799 --> 00:09:13,620
if...

114
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,279
There's no if.

115
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:25,799
Changxuan,

116
00:09:27,860 --> 00:09:29,179
Xiaoyuer and I

117
00:09:31,600 --> 00:09:32,860
will wait for you at home.

118
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:16,720
Dad.

119
00:10:17,059 --> 00:10:17,759
What brings you here?

120
00:10:18,460 --> 00:10:19,340
We're about to set off.

121
00:10:23,759 --> 00:10:24,799
I've left Wu Zuoxiao

122
00:10:25,320 --> 00:10:26,440
a division's worth of troops.

123
00:10:26,820 --> 00:10:28,039
If the battle goes south,

124
00:10:28,399 --> 00:10:29,639
he'll be responsible

125
00:10:29,720 --> 00:10:30,960
for escorting the citizens

126
00:10:31,059 --> 00:10:32,019
to safety in the south.

127
00:10:32,159 --> 00:10:32,639
Alright.

128
00:10:33,419 --> 00:10:34,379
Your guard company

129
00:10:35,100 --> 00:10:36,139
has also been left for you.

130
00:10:36,759 --> 00:10:37,259
No need.

131
00:10:42,279 --> 00:10:43,120
Ye Pingjun.

132
00:10:48,179 --> 00:10:49,120
Don't worry.

133
00:10:49,799 --> 00:10:51,419
I'll be there for your husband

134
00:10:52,899 --> 00:10:53,940
on the battlefield.

135
00:10:55,820 --> 00:10:56,419
You...

136
00:10:57,419 --> 00:10:58,220
You are...

137
00:11:00,059 --> 00:11:02,019
I'm not here to see you off.

138
00:11:05,179 --> 00:11:06,460
Blood is thicker than water.

139
00:11:06,799 --> 00:11:08,259
Father and son are a team.

140
00:11:09,559 --> 00:11:11,480
This battle will be tough.

141
00:11:12,720 --> 00:11:14,100
I'll fight alongside you.

142
00:11:21,679 --> 00:11:22,480
Ready to go.

143
00:11:48,799 --> 00:11:49,500
Move!

144
00:11:50,700 --> 00:11:51,139
Yes, sir!

145
00:11:58,419 --> 00:11:59,200
Move!

146
00:11:59,299 --> 00:11:59,779
Yes, sir!

147
00:12:00,480 --> 00:12:01,259
March.

148
00:12:01,539 --> 00:12:02,299
Yes, sir.

149
00:12:02,980 --> 00:12:04,000
Run.

150
00:12:04,620 --> 00:12:05,080
March.

151
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:05,659
Yes, sir.

152
00:12:06,159 --> 00:12:06,720
March.

153
00:12:06,899 --> 00:12:07,600
Yes, sir.

154
00:12:59,659 --> 00:13:00,179
Sir,

155
00:13:00,259 --> 00:13:01,799
Xiao Beichen, the Commander, has arrived.

156
00:13:33,279 --> 00:13:33,940
Commander Xiao,

157
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:36,200
I've heard so much about you.

158
00:13:38,820 --> 00:13:39,620
I'm also honored

159
00:13:40,100 --> 00:13:41,179
to meet you

160
00:13:41,259 --> 00:13:42,539
at Wubei Port.

161
00:13:45,039 --> 00:13:46,299
On my way here,

162
00:13:47,539 --> 00:13:49,399
I saw many familiar troops

163
00:13:49,659 --> 00:13:51,059
heading to Wubei Pass.

164
00:13:53,159 --> 00:13:54,139
We used to fight each other

165
00:13:54,139 --> 00:13:55,539
for territory,

166
00:13:55,919 --> 00:13:57,120
but now we all know

167
00:13:57,580 --> 00:13:58,559
to turn our guns

168
00:13:59,299 --> 00:14:00,220
against the enemy.

169
00:14:00,539 --> 00:14:01,700
If our nation falls,

170
00:14:02,860 --> 00:14:04,059
we will be defeated soldiers

171
00:14:04,419 --> 00:14:05,240
no matter where we are.

172
00:14:05,700 --> 00:14:06,580
So in this battle,

173
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:08,279
we have no way out

174
00:14:09,059 --> 00:14:10,100
and no division.

175
00:14:12,539 --> 00:14:13,279
That's right.

176
00:14:14,799 --> 00:14:16,600
We stand shoulder to shoulder here

177
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:18,340
with one name,

178
00:14:19,899 --> 00:14:21,080
Chinese soldiers.

179
00:14:22,320 --> 00:14:24,080
Our homeland is behind us.

180
00:14:24,919 --> 00:14:25,919
From now on,

181
00:14:27,159 --> 00:14:27,639
we are

182
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:29,419
brothers-in-arms.

183
00:14:35,500 --> 00:14:36,360
I want to tell you something

184
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,139
to ease your mind.

185
00:14:44,899 --> 00:14:45,960
Your sixth sister, Qixuan,

186
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:47,100
is currently

187
00:14:47,399 --> 00:14:48,360
working as a nurse

188
00:14:48,360 --> 00:14:49,139
in the rear field hospital.

189
00:14:49,960 --> 00:14:50,879
She is safe.

190
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:53,700
Qixuan

191
00:14:54,600 --> 00:14:55,539
left without a word,

192
00:14:55,860 --> 00:14:56,799
saying she was going to find you.

193
00:14:57,659 --> 00:14:58,960
She also wrote back to me,

194
00:14:59,299 --> 00:15:00,419
saying she was grateful

195
00:15:00,419 --> 00:15:01,919
for your care.

196
00:15:08,299 --> 00:15:09,100
Actually,

197
00:15:09,620 --> 00:15:10,580
my life

198
00:15:11,220 --> 00:15:12,460
was saved by her.

199
00:16:35,779 --> 00:16:36,740
You're awake.

200
00:16:55,580 --> 00:16:56,700
Is she your wife?

201
00:16:58,179 --> 00:16:58,799
Yes.

202
00:17:05,960 --> 00:17:09,759
She's so pretty.

203
00:17:21,019 --> 00:17:22,339
I must get back alive

204
00:17:23,819 --> 00:17:24,779
to see her.

205
00:17:29,960 --> 00:17:31,759
Then you must take good care of yourself,

206
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:33,859
and take your medicine properly.

207
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:37,440
Otherwise, how will you go back to see her?

208
00:17:41,180 --> 00:17:41,759
Come,

209
00:17:42,299 --> 00:17:43,900
let me help you change your clothes.

210
00:17:46,940 --> 00:17:47,579
No need.

211
00:17:47,859 --> 00:17:48,480
I'll do it myself.

212
00:17:53,279 --> 00:17:54,039
Alright,

213
00:17:55,140 --> 00:17:56,279
then you go ahead and change.

214
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,579
I'll go outside and prepare your medicine.

215
00:17:59,900 --> 00:18:00,599
Thank you.

216
00:18:28,380 --> 00:18:29,140
Miss,

217
00:18:29,680 --> 00:18:30,519
are you two

218
00:18:30,539 --> 00:18:32,160
getting married soon?

219
00:18:37,099 --> 00:18:38,200
No, ma'am.

220
00:18:39,259 --> 00:18:41,039
He has a wonderful wife

221
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,279
waiting for him at home.

222
00:18:45,339 --> 00:18:47,400
What? You...

223
00:18:48,319 --> 00:18:48,980
Ma'am,

224
00:18:49,900 --> 00:18:51,220
I'm truly happy

225
00:18:51,720 --> 00:18:53,180
that he's still alive.

226
00:18:54,500 --> 00:18:55,619
I just feel

227
00:18:58,460 --> 00:18:59,880
everything is so beautiful

228
00:19:01,400 --> 00:19:02,500
and worthwhile.

229
00:19:10,059 --> 00:19:10,660
Qi Xuan knew

230
00:19:10,660 --> 00:19:12,099
I was bringing troops to Wubei Pass.

231
00:19:13,059 --> 00:19:14,339
She asked me to send you a message.

232
00:19:16,339 --> 00:19:17,140
She told me

233
00:19:18,660 --> 00:19:20,220
you would meet my brother,

234
00:19:20,700 --> 00:19:21,660
and he would

235
00:19:22,099 --> 00:19:23,839
definitely fight the Japanese.

236
00:19:24,759 --> 00:19:25,960
She also told me

237
00:19:27,119 --> 00:19:28,119
that she is fighting too,

238
00:19:29,319 --> 00:19:30,559
and hasn't brought shame to the Yu family.

239
00:19:41,019 --> 00:19:41,779
Thank you.

240
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:58,640
Hurry up!

241
00:19:59,059 --> 00:19:59,539
Pack it down!

242
00:20:01,619 --> 00:20:02,339
This side is done!

243
00:20:03,299 --> 00:20:04,220
Thank you, guys.

244
00:20:04,220 --> 00:20:05,140
The situation is urgent.

245
00:20:05,359 --> 00:20:06,140
We need to work harder.

246
00:20:06,799 --> 00:20:07,279
Yes, sir!

247
00:20:08,299 --> 00:20:09,119
Hurry up!

248
00:20:14,400 --> 00:20:15,140
Faster!

249
00:20:15,420 --> 00:20:16,339
Faster!

250
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,160
Dig deeper!

251
00:20:47,380 --> 00:20:48,220
Take cover!

252
00:20:48,220 --> 00:20:49,339
Everyone, hide!

253
00:20:51,099 --> 00:20:51,779
Spread out!

254
00:20:56,759 --> 00:20:58,119
Get down!

255
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:07,960
Commander,

256
00:21:08,259 --> 00:21:09,279
the East Gate can't hold!

257
00:21:09,380 --> 00:21:10,440
How could it fall?

258
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:11,960
All our men are dead!

259
00:21:14,539 --> 00:21:15,059
Understood.

260
00:21:20,759 --> 00:21:21,319
Dad,

261
00:21:24,740 --> 00:21:26,059
I'm going to the East Gate Command.

262
00:21:27,559 --> 00:21:28,440
You go.

263
00:21:31,160 --> 00:21:31,660
I'll go.

264
00:21:34,000 --> 00:21:34,559
Fine.

265
00:21:53,519 --> 00:21:54,240
Take it.

266
00:21:55,539 --> 00:21:56,279
Take it.

267
00:21:56,680 --> 00:21:57,720
Go and buy some things.

268
00:21:57,819 --> 00:21:58,720
Live a good life.

269
00:21:59,259 --> 00:22:00,339
Here, take it.

270
00:22:02,059 --> 00:22:02,960
This

271
00:22:03,380 --> 00:22:04,539
is double the separation fee

272
00:22:04,539 --> 00:22:06,319
for each of you.

273
00:22:06,920 --> 00:22:08,660
It's enough for you to go home,

274
00:22:09,480 --> 00:22:11,119
buy a few acres of land,

275
00:22:11,380 --> 00:22:12,980
and cover your travel expenses.

276
00:22:15,440 --> 00:22:16,200
My Lady.

277
00:22:16,500 --> 00:22:19,039
My Lady.

278
00:22:19,400 --> 00:22:21,900
Don't cry.

279
00:22:22,579 --> 00:22:24,099
Thank you for

280
00:22:25,579 --> 00:22:27,539
looking after the mansion.

281
00:22:28,960 --> 00:22:30,160
No matter how hard it is,

282
00:22:30,859 --> 00:22:32,680
you must live well.

283
00:22:34,920 --> 00:22:35,700
Get up.

284
00:22:37,259 --> 00:22:37,839
My Lady.

285
00:22:45,259 --> 00:22:46,160
Go.

286
00:22:52,359 --> 00:22:53,259
Wu Zuoxiao.

287
00:22:54,740 --> 00:22:55,180
Yes.

288
00:22:59,440 --> 00:23:00,519
These golds

289
00:23:00,819 --> 00:23:02,799
are all for military supplies.

290
00:23:03,180 --> 00:23:03,880
And tell

291
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:06,039
the Yu's soldiers on the battlefield,

292
00:23:06,579 --> 00:23:07,640
even if

293
00:23:08,059 --> 00:23:10,140
we have to empty our treasury,

294
00:23:10,279 --> 00:23:12,339
we will never leave the Japanese

295
00:23:12,339 --> 00:23:13,839
a single penny.

296
00:23:14,519 --> 00:23:15,460
Your Highness,

297
00:23:16,180 --> 00:23:18,180
on behalf of the entire army,

298
00:23:18,299 --> 00:23:19,640
I thank you.

299
00:24:03,039 --> 00:24:03,500
Ma'am,

300
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:04,940
we've arrived at Linchuan Town.

301
00:24:33,299 --> 00:24:34,140
I didn't expect the Japanese troops

302
00:24:34,140 --> 00:24:35,440
to enter Nanhua so quickly.

303
00:24:35,720 --> 00:24:36,599
What a tragedy!

304
00:24:36,839 --> 00:24:38,440
I heard they're here to capture Mrs. Yu.

305
00:24:38,700 --> 00:24:39,599
They also

306
00:24:39,779 --> 00:24:40,720
detained some servants

307
00:24:40,720 --> 00:24:41,720
who hadn't left the city

308
00:24:42,799 --> 00:24:44,359
to interrogate them about her whereabouts.

309
00:24:45,019 --> 00:24:46,599
God knows how many lives will be lost.

310
00:24:51,059 --> 00:24:51,900
Stop.

311
00:24:55,160 --> 00:24:55,759
Ma'am,

312
00:24:56,160 --> 00:24:57,380
we're not at the ferry yet.

313
00:24:58,420 --> 00:24:59,779
Give me paper and ink.

314
00:25:29,539 --> 00:25:30,480
My Lady.

315
00:25:30,700 --> 00:25:31,420
Zhu,

316
00:25:34,920 --> 00:25:35,700
Mrs. Yu

317
00:25:36,980 --> 00:25:38,559
asked me to give you this.

318
00:25:40,839 --> 00:25:41,640
She said

319
00:25:41,900 --> 00:25:43,359
you must get on the boat

320
00:25:43,900 --> 00:25:45,359
without any delay.

321
00:26:15,880 --> 00:26:16,880
Since

322
00:26:17,319 --> 00:26:19,140
none of you are willing to tell me

323
00:26:19,420 --> 00:26:21,000
where your lady is,

324
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:23,779
I'll fulfill your loyalty.

325
00:26:23,980 --> 00:26:24,660
Get ready.

326
00:26:25,059 --> 00:26:25,660
Go.

327
00:26:25,880 --> 00:26:26,779
Stop.

328
00:26:42,200 --> 00:26:42,839
My Lady.

329
00:26:43,039 --> 00:26:43,960
Why are you back?

330
00:26:44,519 --> 00:26:45,920
My Lady.

331
00:26:45,920 --> 00:26:48,460
Get down.

332
00:26:51,960 --> 00:26:52,920
Mrs. Yu,

333
00:26:53,660 --> 00:26:55,980
you are truly a remarkable woman.

334
00:27:09,259 --> 00:27:12,299
As long as you sign this

335
00:27:12,599 --> 00:27:13,920
and appeal to the Yu's Army

336
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:16,259
to surrender over the radio,

337
00:27:16,819 --> 00:27:19,400
I guarantee their safety.

338
00:27:19,700 --> 00:27:20,900
I can stay,

339
00:27:21,299 --> 00:27:22,240
and you let them go.

340
00:27:22,619 --> 00:27:23,400
My Lady.

341
00:27:23,539 --> 00:27:24,359
My Lady.

342
00:27:25,039 --> 00:27:26,099
My Lady.

343
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:29,980
What do you have to negotiate with me?

344
00:27:30,119 --> 00:27:32,119
If I'm not mistaken,

345
00:27:32,799 --> 00:27:34,240
you want me to step in

346
00:27:34,400 --> 00:27:36,579
and convince my husband and child.

347
00:27:36,740 --> 00:27:39,079
If you want to live,

348
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,539
you must listen to me.

349
00:27:50,900 --> 00:27:52,319
Release them all.

350
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:55,519
My Lady.

351
00:27:55,799 --> 00:27:56,680
Don't kneel.

352
00:27:56,680 --> 00:27:57,720
We won't leave.

353
00:27:57,759 --> 00:27:59,180
Don't kneel. Get up.

354
00:28:00,740 --> 00:28:01,279
Get up.

355
00:28:01,339 --> 00:28:02,119
We won't leave.

356
00:28:03,119 --> 00:28:05,400
Get up. Go.

357
00:28:05,900 --> 00:28:06,740
Go.

358
00:28:07,160 --> 00:28:07,680
My Lady.

359
00:28:07,680 --> 00:28:08,099
Go.

360
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:10,400
Listen to her. Get up and go.

361
00:28:10,559 --> 00:28:11,299
Ma'am.

362
00:28:12,079 --> 00:28:12,960
Ma'am.

363
00:28:18,859 --> 00:28:19,740
Ma'am.

364
00:28:28,940 --> 00:28:29,779
Mrs. Yu.

365
00:28:31,240 --> 00:28:32,220
Please.

366
00:28:43,119 --> 00:28:44,140
Captain Gao Qiao.

367
00:28:45,099 --> 00:28:46,960
You don't understand the rules of Chinese.

368
00:28:47,759 --> 00:28:48,339
Doing this

369
00:28:48,339 --> 00:28:50,279
disgraceful thing

370
00:28:50,279 --> 00:28:52,299
will send me to hell.

371
00:28:52,700 --> 00:28:54,019
Before signing,

372
00:28:54,700 --> 00:28:56,039
I need to go to the ancestral hall

373
00:28:56,720 --> 00:28:59,200
to kneel and confess to my ancestors,

374
00:28:59,640 --> 00:29:01,559
seeking their forgiveness.

375
00:29:07,539 --> 00:29:08,759
The ancestral hall is a sacred place.

376
00:29:09,160 --> 00:29:10,500
It's not appropriate for outsiders

377
00:29:11,140 --> 00:29:12,619
to enter and disturb the ancestors.

378
00:29:14,700 --> 00:29:18,319
I will personally accompany you there.

379
00:29:18,740 --> 00:29:22,319
It would be an honor to pay respects to the ancestors.

380
00:29:59,380 --> 00:30:01,240
[To my ancestors,]

381
00:30:01,740 --> 00:30:03,880
[I, Zhao Baoru,]

382
00:30:04,500 --> 00:30:06,339
[am here to confess my sins.]

383
00:30:21,319 --> 00:30:24,660
[With the invasion of foreign enemies,]

384
00:30:25,079 --> 00:30:28,859
[I failed to protect the country]

385
00:30:29,619 --> 00:30:33,099
[and allowed them to trample on the ancestral hall.]

386
00:30:33,980 --> 00:30:35,720
[This is my first sin.]

387
00:30:41,259 --> 00:30:43,079
[The enemy tried to force me]

388
00:30:44,059 --> 00:30:47,079
[to betray my country,]

389
00:30:48,079 --> 00:30:49,640
[and bring shame to our family.]

390
00:30:51,000 --> 00:30:52,779
[I will never betray]

391
00:30:52,779 --> 00:30:56,059
[the sacrifices of my husband and son,]

392
00:30:56,559 --> 00:30:58,440
[nor tarnish the reputation]

393
00:30:58,500 --> 00:31:01,680
[of the Yu and Zhao families.]

394
00:31:02,480 --> 00:31:04,200
[May the ancestors bear witness.]

395
00:31:35,440 --> 00:31:36,500
Close the door.

396
00:31:59,440 --> 00:32:00,839
[My dear son,]

397
00:32:01,980 --> 00:32:04,500
[I heard that the Japanese invaders broke into the city]

398
00:32:04,660 --> 00:32:07,099
[and imprisoned our fellow villagers in the Yu Mansion.]

399
00:32:08,000 --> 00:32:10,359
[My father taught me that a general]

400
00:32:10,880 --> 00:32:14,420
[must never abandon his people.]

401
00:32:15,599 --> 00:32:17,619
[My husband and my son]

402
00:32:18,339 --> 00:32:19,799
[are both on the battlefield,]

403
00:32:20,119 --> 00:32:22,380
[guarding the nation with their lives.]

404
00:32:23,299 --> 00:32:25,599
[As the head of the Yu family,]

405
00:32:25,839 --> 00:32:27,500
[and the daughter of the Zhao family,]

406
00:32:27,599 --> 00:32:29,720
[how can I possibly remain unharmed]

407
00:32:29,819 --> 00:32:33,140
[while the people of the city are in peril?]

408
00:32:34,619 --> 00:32:36,160
[Do not seek me.]

409
00:32:36,519 --> 00:32:38,000
[Your well-being]

410
00:32:38,539 --> 00:32:40,960
[is the best comfort for me.]

411
00:32:41,440 --> 00:32:42,680
[Do not let me]

412
00:32:42,680 --> 00:32:45,799
[have empty hopes in the end.]

413
00:32:46,960 --> 00:32:48,200
[Having you,]

414
00:32:48,720 --> 00:32:51,200
[my good daughters, in this life,]

415
00:32:51,740 --> 00:32:53,519
[I am truly content.]

416
00:32:54,319 --> 00:32:55,980
[If fate allows,]

417
00:32:56,500 --> 00:32:58,900
[may we be a family again in the next life.]

418
00:33:00,279 --> 00:33:02,960
Mother, Baoru.

419
00:33:03,359 --> 00:33:04,619
Farewell.

420
00:33:45,319 --> 00:33:46,779
Go up there, now!

421
00:33:46,799 --> 00:33:48,039
Hurry up, hurry up!

422
00:33:56,299 --> 00:33:56,960
Changxuan!

423
00:33:58,220 --> 00:33:58,779
Dad,

424
00:33:59,400 --> 00:34:00,180
what are you doing here?

425
00:34:00,559 --> 00:34:01,779
Those damn Japanese

426
00:34:02,220 --> 00:34:04,140
bombed my command post!

427
00:34:26,679 --> 00:34:27,539
March forward!

428
00:34:53,500 --> 00:34:54,139
Shoot!

429
00:34:54,139 --> 00:34:54,619
Commander-in-chief,

430
00:34:54,719 --> 00:34:55,239
Deputy Commander,

431
00:34:55,440 --> 00:34:55,960
the headquarters

432
00:34:55,960 --> 00:34:56,920
can't hold on anymore.

433
00:34:57,139 --> 00:34:58,599
The front line has been broken.

434
00:34:59,639 --> 00:35:00,219
I see.

435
00:35:05,219 --> 00:35:06,019
I'm too old

436
00:35:06,400 --> 00:35:07,219
to run.

437
00:35:07,800 --> 00:35:08,619
You have to go.

438
00:35:08,679 --> 00:35:09,460
But this is the most

439
00:35:09,460 --> 00:35:10,440
heavily defended area.

440
00:35:10,579 --> 00:35:11,420
How can I leave you here?

441
00:35:11,659 --> 00:35:12,760
But the camp is more important.

442
00:35:13,480 --> 00:35:14,599
We have our ammunition

443
00:35:14,599 --> 00:35:15,099
and supplies there.

444
00:35:15,099 --> 00:35:16,519
Everything is there.

445
00:35:16,639 --> 00:35:17,599
If you don't go, who will?

446
00:35:22,460 --> 00:35:23,260
Now,

447
00:35:23,679 --> 00:35:25,880
I order you in the name of the commander-in-chief

448
00:35:25,980 --> 00:35:27,480
to take people to reinforce.

449
00:35:32,019 --> 00:35:32,599
Go.

450
00:35:38,219 --> 00:35:38,860
Hold on.

451
00:36:00,000 --> 00:36:00,739
Changxuan,

452
00:36:04,840 --> 00:36:05,500
remember,

453
00:36:07,119 --> 00:36:08,239
you've always been

454
00:36:09,099 --> 00:36:10,840
my pride and joy.

455
00:37:10,840 --> 00:37:11,599
Director Gu,

456
00:37:11,719 --> 00:37:13,000
the Japanese tanks are coming.

457
00:37:13,199 --> 00:37:14,159
Let's retreat.

458
00:37:25,099 --> 00:37:25,900
We can't.

459
00:37:26,139 --> 00:37:27,599
If we retreat, the flank will be exposed.

460
00:37:28,619 --> 00:37:30,320
You take the rest of the men and go first.

461
00:37:30,320 --> 00:37:31,079
I'm not leaving.

462
00:37:31,139 --> 00:37:32,159
This is an order.

463
00:37:32,360 --> 00:37:33,000
Retreat!

464
00:37:50,059 --> 00:37:50,699
Commander!

465
00:37:50,780 --> 00:37:51,679
We're out of ammo!

466
00:37:52,380 --> 00:37:52,940
Guys!

467
00:37:53,519 --> 00:37:54,300
Fix bayonets!

468
00:38:29,599 --> 00:38:30,340
Gentlemen,

469
00:38:33,079 --> 00:38:34,239
it is my great honor

470
00:38:35,280 --> 00:38:36,559
to stand with you

471
00:38:37,840 --> 00:38:40,159
in defending our nation.

472
00:38:41,219 --> 00:38:42,460
As soldiers,

473
00:38:44,139 --> 00:38:45,860
we protect our homeland.

474
00:38:47,659 --> 00:38:49,280
We are here.

475
00:38:50,440 --> 00:38:52,179
We will never retreat!

476
00:38:52,940 --> 00:38:54,219
China

477
00:38:56,119 --> 00:38:58,460
will never fall!

478
00:39:00,659 --> 00:39:01,519
Charge!

479
00:39:01,599 --> 00:39:02,659
Charge!

480
00:39:04,280 --> 00:39:07,559
Charge!

481
00:39:07,619 --> 00:39:09,059
Forward!

482
00:39:18,739 --> 00:39:21,360
Charge!

483
00:40:35,699 --> 00:40:37,719
You little devils,

484
00:40:37,780 --> 00:40:39,480
open your eyes wide

485
00:40:39,480 --> 00:40:41,539
and see clearly,

486
00:40:42,440 --> 00:40:45,079
we would rather die than surrender!

487
00:40:46,480 --> 00:40:48,119
You won't step

488
00:40:48,420 --> 00:40:51,739
one inch into Chinese territory!

489
00:41:39,639 --> 00:41:40,440
Changxuan.

490
00:41:43,559 --> 00:41:44,619
Changxuan.

491
00:42:03,599 --> 00:42:06,360
[Thank you for blessing his safe return.]

492
00:42:07,300 --> 00:42:08,340
[Otherwise,]

493
00:42:08,800 --> 00:42:09,980
[I would never have the chance]

494
00:42:09,980 --> 00:42:11,320
[to thank you in person.]

495
00:42:11,860 --> 00:42:13,619
[I've come to fulfill my vow.]

496
00:42:14,139 --> 00:42:15,219
[May we all be well]

497
00:42:15,219 --> 00:42:16,440
[from now on.]

498
00:42:17,679 --> 00:42:19,199
[May everything go smoothly for him.]

499
00:42:31,199 --> 00:42:32,900
This world is indeed cold and indifferent,

500
00:42:34,340 --> 00:42:35,400
but you are different.

501
00:42:36,280 --> 00:42:37,420
You hold power,

502
00:42:39,219 --> 00:42:41,260
yet it hasn't clouded your true nature.

503
00:42:43,940 --> 00:42:45,420
I know

504
00:42:46,280 --> 00:42:47,460
who you are

505
00:42:48,500 --> 00:42:50,079
very well.

506
00:42:51,280 --> 00:42:52,539
I know

507
00:42:53,260 --> 00:42:54,219
how we

508
00:42:54,659 --> 00:42:55,599
feel about

509
00:42:55,599 --> 00:42:57,039
each other.

510
00:42:58,840 --> 00:42:59,880
Yu Changxuan,

511
00:43:04,820 --> 00:43:06,920
I want to spend my life with you.

512
00:43:19,960 --> 00:43:21,300
Remember,

513
00:43:23,500 --> 00:43:25,199
no matter what,

514
00:43:26,179 --> 00:43:27,539
you are not alone.

515
00:43:30,059 --> 00:43:31,639
I'll always be there for you.

516
00:44:15,760 --> 00:44:17,500
The soldiers climb mountains and go through forests.

517
00:44:17,579 --> 00:44:19,039
They need sturdy clothes.

518
00:44:19,099 --> 00:44:19,719
Yes.

519
00:44:19,940 --> 00:44:21,219
Especially the bottom of the pants

520
00:44:21,219 --> 00:44:22,440
should be sewn more firmly.

521
00:44:29,840 --> 00:44:30,539
Pingjun,

522
00:44:32,519 --> 00:44:33,360
these articles of yours

523
00:44:33,360 --> 00:44:34,380
are really well written.

524
00:44:34,539 --> 00:44:35,199
We plan to

525
00:44:35,199 --> 00:44:36,000
print more of them.

526
00:44:36,539 --> 00:44:37,480
The reasoning is thorough,

527
00:44:37,599 --> 00:44:38,840
and the language is very friendly.

528
00:44:38,960 --> 00:44:39,840
The villagers can understand it,

529
00:44:40,059 --> 00:44:41,500
and the soldiers are also very spirited after reading it.

530
00:44:41,860 --> 00:44:42,579
Yes,

531
00:44:43,019 --> 00:44:44,099
we need such articles

532
00:44:44,280 --> 00:44:45,519
to mobilize the people

533
00:44:45,619 --> 00:44:46,599
and strengthen their confidence

534
00:44:46,780 --> 00:44:47,559
in such a critical situation.

535
00:44:47,659 --> 00:44:48,400
That's right.

536
00:44:50,980 --> 00:44:51,800
Jin Xuan,

537
00:44:51,980 --> 00:44:52,760
Minru,

538
00:44:52,840 --> 00:44:54,019
thank you too.

539
00:44:54,099 --> 00:44:55,079
You have also made contributions

540
00:44:55,119 --> 00:44:56,159
to the logistical support.

541
00:44:56,780 --> 00:44:57,860
Don't say that.

542
00:44:58,199 --> 00:45:00,340
If you hadn't driven away the bandits,

543
00:45:00,719 --> 00:45:01,519
we wouldn't know

544
00:45:01,519 --> 00:45:02,960
what would happen

545
00:45:03,340 --> 00:45:04,980
to us refugees with families.

546
00:45:05,480 --> 00:45:06,139
Yeah.

547
00:45:06,840 --> 00:45:09,380
We feel happy and relieved

548
00:45:09,639 --> 00:45:11,599
to help you.

549
00:45:11,880 --> 00:45:13,800
Han, Wenbo,

550
00:45:14,800 --> 00:45:15,679
the children

551
00:45:15,880 --> 00:45:16,840
can play

552
00:45:16,840 --> 00:45:17,980
as they do now.

553
00:45:18,059 --> 00:45:19,900
We should be grateful for that.

554
00:45:20,760 --> 00:45:22,000
I hope

555
00:45:23,000 --> 00:45:24,019
there will be

556
00:45:24,719 --> 00:45:25,800
more such days.

557
00:45:46,000 --> 00:45:46,840
Mom,

558
00:45:46,840 --> 00:45:47,739
when will this little tree

559
00:45:47,739 --> 00:45:50,000
grow up?

560
00:45:52,099 --> 00:45:53,639
As long as you take good care of it,

561
00:45:53,639 --> 00:45:55,179
it will grow up soon.

562
00:45:56,019 --> 00:45:58,019
Dad promised us

563
00:45:58,019 --> 00:46:00,320
that we would plant trees together.

564
00:46:00,320 --> 00:46:02,820
When will he come back?

565
00:46:09,260 --> 00:46:10,139
Little fish,

566
00:46:11,340 --> 00:46:12,960
as long as the maple leaves of this tree

567
00:46:12,960 --> 00:46:14,119
turn red,

568
00:46:15,000 --> 00:46:16,539
dad will definitely come back.
